Your role:
Analyze business and functional requirements to design SAP technical solutions;
Develop and maintain SAP programs using ABAP based on functional/technical specs;
Perform unit & integration testing and support deployment to production;
Ensure corrective and evolutionary maintenance of SAP applications;
Build complex SAP queries and optimize system performance;
Collaborate with IT teams and stakeholders to deliver quality solutions.
 Your profile:
Degree in Computer Engineering or equivalent technical background;
Proven experience with ABAP and SQL programming (min. 2 years);
Good understanding of SAP environment and development processes;
Strong analytical thinking and attention to detail;
Effective communication and teamwork skills;
Professional proficiency in English.
 What you'll love about working here:
 Flexible and dynamic work environment involving teams spread across different global locations;
